node_modules/
dist/
# Nothing generates docs/ any more — the pack-time alias was deleted when the
# MCP resource moved to serving wiki/ directly (wiki/decisions/0033-*, which
# supersedes 0029). This entry is kept deliberately, as insurance rather than
# as machinery: CLAUDE.md carries a standing rule that docs/ must never come
# back as a tracked documentation tier (wiki/decisions/0028-*), and one stale
# ignore line is a cheap guard against that recurring mistake.
/docs/
*.tgz
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# Local Claude Code settings + scheduler state (per-machine, not shared)
.claude/
# Transient plan-task working docs (ephemeral; not part of PRs). The plan-*.md
# form is a plan-task/plan-next-issue preserved plan (rename-to-plan-<topic>.md
# when a sequential run keeps a prior issue's still-pending plan).
plan.md
plan-*.md
# Copyright-encumbered, manual-derived C3 reference cache (generated by search-docs tooling)
extracted/c3-reference/
# The construct3-chef-sample fixture is materialized from the construct3-sample
# submodule by `npm run fixture:prep` (the canonical project/ bytes plus the
# bundled addons' archive-sources/ trees). Only chef's own extracted/ golden
# read-surface is tracked — everything else under the dir is generated, so do
# not track it.
/test/fixtures/construct3-chef-sample/*
!/test/fixtures/construct3-chef-sample/extracted/
